[thin] Each leaf bends between its root and its hook as the Pisco cap tips around the meter shoulder and closes over the regulator.
alternatives: Thickening the leaf changes both the entry deflection and the return of the hook onto its ledge. The full-length fitted cover supplies the spring section.
