[sliver] The strip is the flat on top of the spring tip. As the seated cap rolls, the rising strip approaches the roof of its receiver pocket. The full-length fitted cover uses this bearing width.
alternatives: Removing the strip restores a pointed lead-in. Derek observed the pointed front collar toggle and the raised flat front collar stay put in the same quadrant.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/rear-equipment-caps/pisco-snap-cap.step
